{"b":"Ps","c":102,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Hear my prayer, O LORD, and let my cry come unto thee.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.18.6",8,"w"],["Ps.130.1",7,"r"],["Ps.130.2",7,"r"],["Ps.142.2",6,"r"],["Ps.142.3",6,"r"],["Ps.61.2",5,"w"],["Ps.39.12",4,"q"],["Exod.2.23",4,"w"],["2Chr.30.27",3,"w"],["Ps.143.4",3,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Hide not thy face from me in the day when I am in trouble; incline thine ear unto me: in the day when I call answer me speedily.","it":[[37,41],[97,101]],"x":[["Ps.69.17",9,"e"],["Isa.8.17",5,"w"],["Ps.27.9",5,"w"],["Ps.104.29",4,"w"],["Ps.70.1",4,"r"],["Ps.143.7",3,"w"],["Ps.71.2",3,"w"],["Ps.88.2",3,"w"],["Ps.88.18",3,"r"],["1Cor.10.13",3,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"For my days are consumed like smoke, and my bones are burned as an hearth.","x":[["Jas.4.14",7,"r"],["Lam.1.13",4,"w"],["Ps.37.20",4,"w"],["Job.30.30",4,"w"],["Ps.31.10",3,"w"],["Ps.119.83",2,"w"],["Ps.22.14",2,"w"],["Ps.22.15",2,"r"],["Ps.38.3",2,"w"],["Lam.3.4",2,"w"]]},{"n":4,"t":"My heart is smitten, and withered like grass; so that I forget to eat my bread.","x":[["Ps.37.2",5,"w"],["Isa.40.7",5,"w"],["Ezra.10.6",3,"w"],["Ps.77.3",3,"r"],["Ps.102.11",2,"e"],["Job.10.1",2,"r"],["Ps.69.20",2,"r"],["Matt.26.37",2,"r"],["Matt.26.38",2,"r"],["1Sam.1.7",2,"r"]]},{"n":5,"t":"By reason of the voice of my groaning my bones cleave to my skin.","x":[["Job.19.20",5,"w"],["Lam.4.8",4,"w"],["Prov.17.22",3,"w"],["Ps.6.8",3,"r"],["Ps.38.8",2,"w"],["Ps.38.10",2,"r"],["Ps.6.6",2,"w"],["Ps.32.3",2,"w"],["Ps.32.4",2,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"I am like a pelican of the wilderness: I am like an owl of the desert.","x":[["Isa.38.14",4,"r"],["Zeph.2.14",4,"r"],["Rev.18.2",3,"r"],["Isa.34.11",3,"w"],["Isa.34.15",3,"w"],["Job.30.29",3,"r"],["Job.30.30",3,"r"],["Mic.1.8",2,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"I watch, and am as a sparrow alone upon the house top.","x":[["Ps.77.4",6,"r"],["Ps.38.11",3,"r"],["Lam.3.28",2,"w"],["Lam.3.30",2,"r"],["Ps.130.6",2,"w"],["Mark.14.33",2,"r"],["Mark.14.37",2,"w"],["Deut.28.66",2,"r"],["Deut.28.67",2,"r"],["Ps.22.2",2,"r"]]},{"n":8,"t":"Mine enemies reproach me all the day; and they that are mad against me are sworn against me.","it":[[38,41]],"x":[["Acts.26.11",4,"w"],["Ps.69.9",3,"r"],["Ps.69.10",3,"w"],["Ps.69.20",2,"w"],["Isa.65.15",2,"r"],["Ps.89.51",2,"w"],["Acts.23.12",2,"r"],["Acts.23.35",2,"r"],["Ps.31.11",2,"w"],["Ps.31.13",2,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"For I have eaten ashes like bread, and mingled my drink with weeping,","x":[["Ps.42.3",5,"r"],["Ps.80.5",3,"w"],["Lam.3.48",2,"r"],["Lam.3.49",2,"r"],["Ps.69.21",2,"w"],["Mic.1.10",2,"r"],["Mic.7.17",2,"r"],["Isa.44.20",2,"w"],["Lam.3.15",2,"r"],["Lam.3.16",2,"w"]]},{"n":10,"t":"Because of thine indignation and thy wrath: for thou hast lifted me up, and cast me down.","x":[["Ps.38.3",5,"r"],["Ps.90.7",3,"w"],["Ps.90.9",3,"w"],["Ps.147.6",3,"r"],["2Cor.4.9",3,"r"],["Dan.9.8",2,"r"],["Dan.9.14",2,"r"],["Rom.3.19",2,"r"],["1Sam.2.7",2,"r"],["1Sam.2.8",2,"r"]]},{"n":11,"t":"My days are like a shadow that declineth; and I am withered like grass.","it":[[8,11]],"x":[["Job.14.2",5,"w"],["Ps.109.23",5,"e"],["Ps.144.4",4,"w"],["1Pet.1.24",3,"w"],["Eccl.6.12",2,"w"],["Ps.39.5",2,"r"],["Ps.39.6",2,"r"],["Isa.40.6",2,"w"],["Isa.40.8",2,"w"],["Jas.1.10",2,"w"]]},{"n":12,"t":"But thou, O LORD, shalt endure for ever; and thy remembrance unto all generations.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.135.13",10,"e"],["Lam.5.19",8,"r"],["Exod.3.15",7,"e"],["Heb.13.8",6,"r"],["Ps.9.7",6,"e"],["Isa.44.6",4,"r"],["Rev.1.17",4,"r"],["Rev.1.18",4,"r"],["Ps.102.24",3,"w"],["Ps.102.27",3,"r"]]},{"n":13,"t":"Thou shalt arise, and have mercy upon Zion: for the time to favour her, yea, the set time, is come.","it":[[18,21]],"x":[["Gal.4.4",16,"r"],["Isa.40.2",15,"r"],["Isa.60.1",15,"w"],["Ps.44.26",14,"w"],["Zech.2.10",11,"w"],["Zech.2.12",11,"r"],["Ps.69.35",10,"w"],["Ps.69.36",10,"r"],["Rev.11.15",10,"r"],["Rev.11.18",10,"r"]]},{"n":14,"t":"For thy serv